<title>UK: NatWest seen sharply lower on big option loss.</title>
<headline>NatWest seen sharply lower on big option loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in National Westminster Bank Plc were seen opening sharply lower on Monday as the stock went ex-dividend and the market reacts to Friday's late statement that the bank would take a 50 million stg charge to cover options pricing errors.</p>
</text>
